        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“When any one brings a cereal offering as an offering to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", his offering shall be of fine flour; he shall pour oil upon it, and put frankincense on it, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and bring it to Aaron's sons the priests. And he shall take from it a handful of the fine flour and oil, with all of its frankincense; and the priest shall burn this as its memorial portion upon the altar, an offering by fire, a pleasing odor to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And what is left of the cereal offering shall be for Aaron and his sons; it is a most holy part of the offerings by fire to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.2.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“When you bring a cereal offering baked in the oven as an offering, it shall be unleavened cakes of fine flour mixed with oil, or unleavened wafers spread with oil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And if your offering is a cereal offering baked on a griddle, it shall be of fine flour unleavened, mixed with oil; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "you shall break it in pieces, and pour oil on it; it is a cereal offering. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And if your offering is a cereal offering cooked in a pan, it shall be made of fine flour with oil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And you shall bring the cereal offering that is made of these things to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "; and when it is presented to the priest, he shall bring it to the altar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the priest shall take from the cereal offering its memorial portion and burn this on the altar, an offering by fire, a pleasing odor to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And what is left of the cereal offering shall be for Aaron and his sons; it is a most holy part of the offerings by fire to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.2.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“No cereal offering which you bring to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " shall be made with leaven; for you shall burn no leaven nor any honey as an offering by fire to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "As an offering of first fruits you may bring them to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", but they shall not be offered on the altar for a pleasing odor. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You shall season all your cereal offerings with salt; you shall not let the salt of the covenant with your God be lacking from your cereal offering; with all your offerings you shall offer salt.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.2.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“If you offer a cereal offering of first fruits to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", you shall offer for the cereal offering of your first fruits crushed new grain from fresh ears, parched with fire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And you shall put oil upon it, and lay frankincense on it; it is a cereal offering. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the priest shall burn as its memorial portion part of the crushed grain and of the oil with all of its frankincense; it is an offering by fire to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.2.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
